				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>Latest Update Overview</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/7b83d212f395ecf134f3826aba3d77e6.avif?t=1793180731" width=724 height=2172 /></span></p></p>
			</div>
			</div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/c722082b7e70e67708813f7b3113c6d2.avif?t=1793180731" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras_big/c722082b7e70e67708813f7b3113c6d2.avif?t=1793180731 width=1560 height=936 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/774269f69b5ee813662e2e8bad35f3d5.avif?t=1793180731" width=970 height=150 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Massive Heroes × Roguelike Building × Mow-Down Combat</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Dungeon Brawls is an action roguelike game that supports 4-player co-op. Choose from dozens of available heroes, and freely combine hundreds of skills and relics. Team up with friends and challenge the bloody battles against hordes of enemies!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/946a429bd507771e4dd5ae6c0fcc0f39.poster.avif?t=1793180731" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/946a429bd507771e4dd5ae6c0fcc0f39.webm?t=1793180731" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/946a429bd507771e4dd5ae6c0fcc0f39.mp4?t=1793180731" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Multiplayer Co-op</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The game supports 4-player online co-op. Fight solo or alongside friends, cleverly combine each character's strengths to build a powerful lineup, and enjoy a relaxing, thrilling grass-cutting experience!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.poster.avif?t=1793180731" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.webm?t=1793180731" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.mp4?t=1793180731" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Vast Skills &amp; Equipment, Free Roguelike Building</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Playable Heroes: 10 anime-style characters</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Skill System: 50+ skills to combine freely</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Relic System: 80+ randomly dropped relics</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.poster.avif?t=1793180731" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.webm?t=1793180731" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.mp4?t=1793180731" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" > </p><h2 class="bb_tag" > Diverse Builds, Thrilling Combat Experience</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Physical builds, spell builds, effect builds, defense builds, summon builds, transformation builds...</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Whatever playstyle you prefer, you can find your own way to fight in Dungeon Brawls!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Combining the precise skill execution of MOBA games, rich and varied systems, and exhilarating cooperative gameplay, experience an unprecedented, thrilling roguelike adventure!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.poster.avif?t=1793180731" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.webm?t=1793180731" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/1e3c74ed41d7e366df6eca3e5c400c17.mp4?t=1793180731" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/7a9cba433833caa87b548988e22d903c.avif?t=1793180731" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras_big/7a9cba433833caa87b548988e22d903c.webp?t=1793180731 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>New Map: Fallen Kingdom Ruins!</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Take on brand-new bosses including the <strong>Titan, Bomb Demon, Armored Skeleton, and the Three Experimental Brothers</strong>. Each boss features unique combat mechanics and new challenges.<br><strong>Do you have what it takes to reach the top of the dungeon?</strong><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/361bec101f788fcfef98928a489177fe.poster.avif?t=1793180731" width=856 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/361bec101f788fcfef98928a489177fe.webm?t=1793180731" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/361bec101f788fcfef98928a489177fe.mp4?t=1793180731" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Brand-New Artifact System!</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Choose between <strong>Light, Darkness, and Balance</strong> to unlock completely different artifact mechanics.<br>Stay true to the Light, embrace the Darkness, or maintain the Balance — <strong>your path will directly shape your build and change the course of each run.</strong><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/44432f30aff918be4b58c9f028cc6074.poster.avif?t=1793180731" width=856 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/44432f30aff918be4b58c9f028cc6074.webm?t=1793180731" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246640/extras/44432f30aff918be4b58c9f028cc6074.mp4?t=1793180731" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p>						</div>
					</div>
